    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE BY PRIVATE TREATY\r\nEoin Kane, Auctioneer & Valuer, Drumshanbo, Co Leitrim, is pleased to offer for sale this derelict house and 8.84 hectares of farm land at Lung, Ballaghaderreen, Co Roscommon, F45 DH02.\r\n\r\nIt is located just a 3 minute drive from the town of Ballaghaderreen.\r\nThis is a unique opportunity to acquire a parcel of roadside agricultural land.  The derelict house has been unoccupied for a number of years, therefore will qualify for the Home Improvement Grant.\r\nThis is an attractive parcel of farm land, in a strong natural setting, surrounded by mature hedges with a stream running along the bottom. \r\nFor further details or to arrange a viewing, contact:\r\nEoin Kane\r\nDrumshanbo\r\nCo Leitrim\r\nPhone No 071 9641400 of 086 8392568\r\nEmail: eoinkaneauctioneer@gmail.com\r\nPSRA No: 002309"
      },
